RESULTS

X-ray of the left arm shows no evidence of elbow fracture.

Endoscopy showed gastritis.

ASSESSMENT AND PLAN

Anna Brown is a 26-year-old female with a past medical history significant for epilepsy, depression, and peptic ulcer disease who presents with left elbow pain.

Epilepsy.
• Medical Reasoning: The patient reports that she has not had any seizures in the past year. She is still taking Keppra.
