• Additional Testing: None.
• Medical Treatment: Continue Protonix 40 mg once a day before meals.

Left Elbow Pain.
• Medical Reasoning: The patient has erythema, edema, and pain to palpation of the olecranon. Her x-ray shows no evidence of elbow fracture.
