3. Diabetes mellitus type 2.
   • Medical treatment: Increase metformin to 1000 mg twice a day. Order for HbA1c.

Patient Agreements: The patient understands and agrees with the recommended medical treatment plan.

INSTRUCTIONS

The patient will follow up with me in a couple of weeks for her diabetes and elbow pain. She will follow up with diabetic counseling. }}<|eot_id|>
